{"id":121,"titulo":"¡Adiós Lenin! (2003)","titulo_orig":"Good Bye, Lenin!","poster":"https://compucalitv.tv/wp-content/uploads/thumbs/819f46e52c25763a55cc642422644317_hd.webp","release_date":"2003-02-13","genres":["drama","comedia"],"rating":"7.6","backdrop":"/backdrops/819f46e52c25763a55cc642422644317.webp","overview":"Berlín, octubre de 1989. Unos días antes de la caída del Muro, la madre de Alex, una mujer orgullosa de sus ideas comunistas, entra en coma. Cuando despierta ocho meses después, su hijo hará lo posible y lo imposible para que no se entere de que está viviendo en una Alemania reunificada y capitalista. Su objetivo es convertir el apartamento familiar en una isla anclada en el pasado, una especie de museo del socialismo en el que su madre viva cómodamente creyendo que nada ha cambiado.","trailer":"mIjSaHUKD5I","runtime":"121.0","slug":"adios-lenin-2003","servidores":[{"id":1,"url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-s67de16ftcpx.html","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Vimeos","calidad":"Full HD","embed_id":"","player_url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-s67de16ftcpx.html"},{"id":2,"url":"https://goodstream.one/embed-w8jixhi1jbq6.html","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Goodstream","calidad":"Full HD","embed_id":"","player_url":"https://goodstream.one/embed-w8jixhi1jbq6.html"},{"id":3,"url":"https://hlswish.com/e/skvf1bdyrokk","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Hlswish","calidad":"Full HD","embed_id":"","player_url":"https://hlswish.com/e/skvf1bdyrokk"},{"id":4,"url":"https://voe.sx/e/t5ogjc2gdyvv","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Voe","calidad":"Full HD","embed_id":"","player_url":"https://voe.sx/e/t5ogjc2gdyvv"},{"id":5,"url":"https://filemoon.sx/e/8z1g5pahrqz9","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Filemoon","calidad":"Full HD","embed_id":"","player_url":"https://filemoon.sx/e/8z1g5pahrqz9"},{"id":6,"url":"https://voe.sx/e/dqgr2x64dujw","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Voe","calidad":"Full HD","embed_id":"","player_url":"https://voe.sx/e/dqgr2x64dujw"}]}